  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So we've been talking it out and everyone has agreed not to fight each other. Or us. So long as we never mention what destroyed the Tritons.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-WHITE_108.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You cannot know what destroyed the Tritons. That knowledge is forbidden.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_TreeF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Arbora_of_the_Tree_Clan_AH-WHITE_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Exactly. That's why we ain't asking... right, kid? It's some kinda security measure. We can't be too direct.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-WHITE_155.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752268,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So you were talking about dreams, right?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-WHITE_109.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There were dreams, yes, terrible dreams. There were nights where the whole city was haunted by the silence in the sky. The song had stopped.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_TreeF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Arbora_of_the_Tree_Clan_AH-WHITE_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then they appeared: the Primal Beings, the singers and the forgotten. They can restore us... if we make amends.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_ Khrulhu_Bird_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Avio_of_the_Raven_Clan_AH-WHITE_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There is no amends to be made, only mistakes to be put down. We are each readying to abandon this city, taking the knowledge we require.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_BugF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Weaver_of_the_Spider_Clan_AH-WHITE_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "My clan has taken the knowledge of magic into the Dead Cells to fight back against the nightmares.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_TreeF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Arbora_of_the_Tree_Clan_AH-WHITE_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "While the other two clans fight now over our Weapons Stockpile.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_ Khrulhu_Bird_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Avio_of_the_Raven_Clan_AH-WHITE_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Magic and Weapons... seem like good leads, eh Wizard? We'll keep the peace here.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-WHITE_110.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
